New single-window GUI (Qt Quick): one window with Overview, Layout, Server, Computers, Security, Processes and Settings pages; the role is a switch and both roles' settings stay reachable; join and fingerprint requests appear inline instead of pop-ups; the processes behind the service (app, core, Windows service, discovery) show their state; the screen-dimming options are configurable; the layout places each computer's desktop freely, sized from its displays, and links touching edges (with ranges when only part of an edge touches); light and dark follow the system. English only. Needs Qt 6.8 or newer.
